* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
# The synthesised corpus and the trained weights. Marked binary explicitly as
# well as by the *.gz rule
# below: line-ending normalisation on a gzip member changes the bytes, the
# regenerated corpus then differs from the committed one, and `dslm check`
# fails on a Linux runner while passing on the machine that wrote it.
*.jsonl.gz binary
*.npz binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gz binary
*.onnx binary
*.safetensors binary
